# Flood Evacuation no longer needs any environment variables.
#
# It originally used the Google Maps Platform (which needs a billing
# account) but has been migrated to a fully free, key-less geographic
# stack: Leaflet + OpenStreetMap tiles for the map, the Overpass API for
# candidate destinations, Open-Elevation for elevation, and the OSRM public
# demo server for walking routes. See the "Flood Evacuation" section in
# README.md for details and the fallback behavior of each service.
#
# This file is kept only so a future real API integration (if ever added)
# has an obvious place to document its variables.
